    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR 27 October 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      195.89,
      195.62,
      401.05,
      208.1
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 5.30 a.m. on 27 October 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      212.39,
      536.92,
      322.01
    ],
    "text": "The Severe Cyclonic Storm \u201cArnab\u201d over West central Bay of Bengal intensified into a \u2018Very Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 and lay centered at 02.30 a.m. of today, the 27th October, 2026 over the near latitude 15.9\u00b0N and longitude 85.4\u00b0E about 890 km to the north-east of Kankasanthurai. It is very likely to continue to move west-northwestwards till 05.30 p.m. of 27th October and thereafter, it is very likely to move northwestwards and cross the Indian land through Andhra Pradesh coast as a very severe cyclonic storm by 11.30 a.m. of 28th October, 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      325.16,
      538.37,
      445.51
    ],
    "text": "Although this system is not expected to have a direct impact on Sri Lanka, the showery condition over the southwestern parts of the island is expected continue today, as the wind flow associated with the system extends across the island. Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Southern and North-western provinces and in Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts and, fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      448.18,
      524.93,
      470.83
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur at a few places after 1.00 p.m. in the Eastern province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      474.13,
      538.37,
      528.31
    ],
    "text": "Strong winds of about (40-50) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, Northern, North-central and North-western provinces and in Trincomalee and Hambantota Districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      531.1,
      537.86,
      569.14
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      3.0,
      12.0
